          "signature": "theorem two_heights (N : ℕ) [NeZero N] (h g : SL(2,ℤ)) (ψ φ : SmoothHeightSeed) (t : ℝ) :\n    physicalProduct N h g ψ φ t = gramIntegrand N g h ψ φ (1/2) t + gramIntegrand N g h ψ φ (1/2) (-t)"
