          "signature": "theorem scalar_pole (N : ℕ) [NeZero N] (g h : SL(2,ℤ)) (ψ φ : SmoothHeightSeed) :\n    Tendsto (fun s : ℂ => (s-1)*scalar N g h ψ φ s) (𝓝[≠] 1) (𝓝 (residue N ψ φ))"
